window.products.push({"id":647016,"name":"Satin Pillowcase for Hair and Skin -Bed Pillow Cases Standard Size Set of 2,Satin Pillowcase 20x26 inches, Solid Color Pillow Covers with Envelope Clo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510mhFko8oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Satin Pillowcase:Satin Pillowcases are made of 100% satin polyester fabric for optimal softness and easy care used is as soft as a silk pillowcase. High-quality satin is more sturdy than silk pillowcases,soft and comfortable, smooth and breathable, not easy to wrinkle, easy to clean and not easy to deformation. Best for hair and skin:When you lie on the satin pillowcase, it can reduce the friction on your curly hair, better protect your hair, and will not absorb your skin moisture while you sleep, so your skin is healthie.Satin pillow cover is much softer and less harsh than any thread count of cotton, no more creases or pulling on your skin.It’s your best choice to pamper the delicate skin on your face! Envelope Closure Design:The envelope-style satin pillowcase can help you put in and out the pillow more conveniently, and the design without zipper can prevent you from being entangled with other clothes when cleaning the pillowcase.The Envelope closure end design prevents your pillows escaping from pillowcase during your sweet dream. Easy to Clean:Simple and stylish, easy to put in or take out the pillow.Turn the satin pillow case inside out, place inside a mesh laundry bag, and wash with a mild detergent. The cooling luxury satin pillowcase holds up great in cold delicate wash and better AIR DRY it hanging on a rack instead of tumble dry. Easy to care for, machine wash cold, gentle cycle, low temperature tumble dry, cold iron if necessary. Note: Please do not bleach. Ideal Gift Choice:Our satin pillowcase is not only for women, but also for men, children, and the elderly, it can be a luxury gift for birthday, Valentine's Day, Christmas, Thanksgiving Day gifts.We offer a 90-day satisfaction guarantee, just feel free to contact us if you have any problems, our 24h customer service team will work with you to make it right! But in case you don't, we offer a 100% money back guarantee. No questions asked. Because we want you to be happy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510mhFko8oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"fokusent","source_asin":"B0BPSQJCP8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-647016","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPSQJCP8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPSQJCP8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
