window.products.push({"id":647113,"name":"Raajsee Natural Incense Cones,6 Pack Mixed Scents Gift Pack 15 pc Each (90 Total), Insense Cones Variety Pack, 100% Organic Non Toxic Natural - Hand R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.78,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ex0VisotL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Raajsee Incense features the largest selection of incense sticks in over 50 captivating fragrances. All our inciensos aromaticos is handcrafted and sealed in protective bags to ensure freshness. We have earned our reputation of excellence by blending exceptional essences with only the highest quality ingredients. The Raajsee Fragrance is also known for it’s longer burn times & Non Toxic Blends  our Hand rolled Cones burns 2 to 3 times longer than most scented cones sold here. Raajsee insenses Cones Are Made in India using all-natural selective herbs according to ancient tradition. Pure incense scents contains organic and non-toxic incense ingredients, including, essential oils, herbs, and wood gums. Every incense kit of this extraordinary selection is fashioned by hand, dipped in the finest oils and then gently seasoned. HOW TO USE- After lighting the incense cone’s tip using a match or lighter, it is important to allow 5 to 20 seconds to pass before snuffing out the flame. Once it is blown out, a wafting spiral of smoke emanating from the tip of the incense cone signals the embers have caught and the cone is beginning to incense burn. Insense has been used since ancient times and has done nothing but gain popularity in recent years. The uses for insense burn are endless. Here are just a few reasons people buy Raajsee Incense spirtual things (1) Odor Elimination (2) Meditation (3) Yoga (4) Aromatherapy (5) Parties (6) Gift Items We have over 50 best fragrances line up to choose from : sandalwood, white cedar , frank incense , palo santo sticks , cinnamon , rose, lavender, oudh , nag champa , patchouli , white sage , vanilla , jasmine , super hit , citronella , orange blossom , dragon’s blood , eucalyptus , copal","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ex0VisotL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"raajsee","source_asin":"B0BR39C5F1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-647113","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR39C5F1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR39C5F1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
