window.products.push({"id":647205,"name":"Bento Box,Bacxigo Bento Lunch Box for Kids and Adults,Leak and Shock Proof Lunch Containers,Mom’s Choice Kids Lunch Boxes with 3 Compartments, Microwa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c1QU3IsJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【LEAK PROOF AND FOOD SEPERATED】This Bacxigo bento box has a waterproof ring design and a lock on each side to ensure that the food will not leak and the food is fresh. And very easy to open and close. There are three compartments inside, you can divide the food according to your preferences, suitable for adults, and also suitable for children to share together. For childrens, sharing is happy! 【SAFETY KIDS LUNCH BOX】. The main raw material use the natural wheat fiber . It is safe and reliable,making it healthy for our planet and for our children. No BPAs and no chemical dyes, you can eat delicious food with no worries.Highly recommend. 【MICROWAVE AND DISHWASHER SAFE】. Bacxigo Bento lunch box is very user friendly.Microwave Safe(without lids, <3 mins under 230℉); Freezer Safe(≧-68℉).Dishwasher Safe(without lids,hand washing is recommended for the lid to avoid any deformation caused by high temperature and pressure washing) 【PORTABLE AND ONE REPLACES MULTIPLE】. The size of Bacxigo bento box for kids is 9 * 5.9 * 2.2 inches, which can hold enough food and easy to carry. You can easily put this lunch boxes for kids in your bag without worrying about food leaking, so you can enjoy your food anywhere.Which is very inconvenient to carry. Suitable for adults, but also for people party, picnics in the park, etc. 【WHAT YOU GET AND ATTENTIVE SERVICE】: Bacxigo Large bento box*1 , Reusable wheat fiber fork*1, 1 Year Warranty, and lifetime customer support.You can rest assured of the use!you can contact us if you have any quality problems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c1QU3IsJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bacxigo","source_asin":"B09J2H1STC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-647205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J2H1STC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J2H1STC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
