window.products.push({"id":647309,"name":"Things2Die4 Cafe De Marguerites Vintage Style Pendulum Wall Clock 23 in.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MS0iBQblL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"This French `Cafe Des Marguerite`s` inspired wall clock features a faux aged, yellowed vintage finish, big bold easy to read digits, visible hands, and a working pendulum. This 22.75-inch (58 cm) diameter, 1.75-inch (4 cm) deep clock is made from pressed wood covered with printed vinyl with a metal accented pendulum window. It easily hangs using the attached keyhole hanger on the back, and with a Fleur De Lis French lily symbol, it`s sure to liven up your Paris-themed kitchen, entryway, or cafe! It requires just 2 AA batteries (not included), and makes a wonderful housewarming gift!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MS0iBQblL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Things2Die4","source_asin":"B00JV68TH0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-647309","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JV68TH0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JV68TH0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
