window.products.push({"id":647545,"name":"Vinod Mixing Bowls with Lids - Set of 6 Stainless Steel Nesting Bowl | Meal Prep Bowls | Mix & Serve | Flat Bottom & Stackable | Heavy Duty & Easy to ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K4rnl70cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥣STACKABLE BOWLS: Mixing Bowls of multiple sizes, these bowls from Vinod Cookware come in an incredibly versatile set suitable for almost every task, from meal preparation to baking or just making some salads these bowls will assist you in most situations. Made from 100% Food-Grade Premium Stainless Steel ensuring immaculate quality and long-lasting durability are achieved. Crafted to make your cooking process much more efficient and provide an alluring look to your utensil. 🪄PRIME-QUALITY CRAFTSMANSHIP: Vinod Mixing Bowls are packed with features and made with dazzling craftsmanship which makes these Bowls a one-of-a-kind necessity. Stainless Steel quality that is food-graded, BPA free, corrosion, and rust-resistant with the dimensions of each bowl being ¾, 1.5, 3, 4, 5, and 8 Quarts respectively to help you prepare that perfect meal. Toss your worries away with these Mixing Bowls 🧡 💯FEATURE-FRIENDLY: Comes with a lofty set of features to provide a complete value for money product. Flat Bottoms in each bowl help provide reliability and stability which makes your bowls stay at ease while you work your magic. Shatter Proof and Freezer safe helps in assuring that your bowls won’t stick or get rusted when kept inside your refrigerators while being Dishwasher Safe helps in cleaning your bowls with comfort and ease. 🌟ERGONOMICAL AND VERSATILE: With their ergonomic design and flat bottoms these mixing bowls are beneficial in multiple situations. Tossing of salads, whisking of eggs to whipping creams these mixing bowls have it all covered. And, these salad bowls or serving bowls seamlessly stack together and offer space-efficient storage that helps de-clutter kitchen cupboards while adding some style and sophistication. 🤝COMES WITH A PROMISE: We at Vinod Cookware take customer satisfaction profoundly. We strive in providing the highest quality products to our customers. In the unlikely event of any issues, please feel free to contact us, we will do all we can to assist you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K4rnl70cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VINOD","source_asin":"B0BZZB31F9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-647545","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZZB31F9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZZB31F9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":647546,"name":"Tovolo Silicone Fork - White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QmgfQPJcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Let's get right to the point: Our unique, nylon-tipped prongs give you sure stabbing ability and are safe for non-stick cookware. Designed with the hard, durable nylon core exposed at the tips, our Fork is ideal for piercing meat and vegetables as well as turning items in a pan. At Tovolo, we believe time spent cooking should be fun and we are honored to be a part of that experience in each home that uses our products. We challenge ourselves to improve the performance, function, and appearance of kitchen tools. Something as simple as a silicone spatula moves us to create the perfect experience for our customers. We obsess over every detail to ensure that our spatula will outperform expectations. However, performance alone is not enough; we want to put a smile on the customer’s face as well. Whether it is our Spatulart silicone spatulas, our assortment of frozen pop molds or our whimsically shaped ice molds, we strive to add a colorful element of fun to each of our items, to do just that.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QmgfQPJcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tovolo","source_asin":"B00FAP1J9G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-647546","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FAP1J9G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FAP1J9G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
