window.products.push({"id":647602,"name":"Stainless Steel Mixing Bowls with Lids (Set of 3), Footek Non-Slip Silicone Bottom Size 5, 2.5, 2QT, Kitchen Nesting Bowl for Mixing, Baking, Serving,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X9djYXDrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎉🎉Welcome to Footek!🎉 Footek Mixing Bowls are made of BPA-free, FOOD GRADE Silicone Anti-rust 304(18/8) Stainless Steel. Non-slip bottoms keep bowls from moving around on the countertop during whisking. Tightly sealed lids keep food fresh and convenient for storing food. Exquisite craft, beautiful appearance very suitable for all kitchen styles! Creative gifts for for New Year, birthday, wedding, house-warming or any other occasions. 💐Stainless Steel Mixing Bowls With Lids Set: ➤Bowls 1: 5 QT--11×11×5.4 inch ➤Bowls 2: 2.5 QT--8.7×8.7×4.2 inch ➤Bowls 3: 2 QT--8×8×4 inch 💐Why Stainless Steel Mixing Bowls More Worthwhile? ✅【Premium Stainless Steel】 Stainless steel, rust-proof, dent resistant, durable than glass bowls and plastic bowls. ✅【Non Slip Bottoms】 Non-slip silicone bottoms keep bowls steadily, balanced while mixing, whisking and beating. ✅【Air Tight Lids】 Air-tight lid keep food fresh longer, convenient for taking out without spilling. ✅【Nesting & Stackable】 Bowls and lids can be nested with each other, easy storage, saving-space. ✅【Deepen Bowls & Wide Rims】 Deepen bowls hold more ingredients, wide rim comfortable to hold. ✅【Easy To Clean】 Just wash them with soap or put them in the dishwasher. Dishwasher & Refrigerator & Freezer Safe. ✅【Multi Purpose】 Not only party, festivals, gathering, bakery, picnic, Also as serving bowls and fruit veggie container. 💖Sweet Tips: 1.Please remember to clean bowls with water or detergent before the first time. 2.Bowls are dishwasher safe, Lids hand-wash recommended in order to maintain the tight seal. 😊Customer Warranty: If you have any question about our products, welcome to contact with us. We will try our best to make each customer 100% satisfied!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X9djYXDrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Footek","source_asin":"B096KHG231","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-647602","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096KHG231","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096KHG231","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
