window.products.push({"id":647687,"name":"yamagahome Desk Cup Holder Clamp with Hanging Storage Bag, 2 in 1 Table Cup Holder Clip for Desk, Anti-Spill Tableside Cup Holder with Hanging Organiz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DavvU7fML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Premium Quality Material & Ample Storage Space】Our hanging storage bag is crafted from top-notch 600D Oxford fabric, ensuring it is firm, durable, and odorless. The bag features 7 pockets, perfectly designed to store all your necessities. This premium tableside pocket is ideal for keeping your phone, textbooks, files, magazines, eyeglasses, iPad, and snacks within reach. 【Fits Most Drinkware & U-Shaped Slot】Measuring 8.07\" x 3.54\" x 3.93\" inches, our desk cup holder can accommodate cups with a diameter of up to 3.74\" inches, fitting most 18-32oz bottles. It can hold glasses, cans, cups, large to-go cups, tumblers, thermoses, and bottles. The bottom of the handle slot is approximately 0.67 inches from the bottom. Our large cup holders can perfectly hold cups with handles without tilting or spilling. You can use it to place your coffee, juice, wine, beer, or cola. 【Designed for Convenience】Our drink holder comes with a tray for storing other office supplies, such as pens, staplers, scissors, rulers, compasses, remote controls, and more. Keep them handy whenever you need them. This clamp cup holder can also keep your snacks and drinks close to your computer desk while you work. It weighs only 0.77lb but can bear at least 6.61lb, making it stable and strong for daily use. 【No Drill Needed & Desk Protection】Our cup holder comes with a clamp mount that makes it easy to install and remove. Tighten the black knob downward by hand instead of drilling a hole or using glue to attach it to the underside of your desk, leaving no damage to your desk. The soft padding between the clamp prevents your desk from getting scratched. The fixture is suitable for tables with a thickness of 0.5 to 1.97 inches on top. 【Widely Applicable】Our cup holder is perfect for creating extra storage space in college dorm rooms, living rooms, desks, game tables, painting tables, traveling on a cruise, staying in a hospital, and more. It maximizes unused space in dorm rooms, apartments, and RVs. You can also send it as a thoughtful gift to your friends during Christmas, Thanksgiving, the school season, and other festivals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DavvU7fML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"yamagahome","source_asin":"B0C5CK9F2S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-647687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5CK9F2S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5CK9F2S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":647688,"name":"MEETSKY Boho Curtains for Living Room Light Filtering Privacy Protection Cotton Curtains 84 Inch Length 2 Panels Bohemian Linen Style Back Tab Window ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91W7kXS140L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE USE: Our boho curtains suit most windows and rooms and can be hung separately or used with shutters. Perfect for home decor such as bedroom, living room and dining room. HANGING OPTIONS: 3-Way hang these curtain panels (1) using the back tab to create an elegant pleated effect (2) using the 1.7-inch rod pocket for a classic look (3) using clip rings for easy, slide-open and closed (clip rings are not included) SOFT COTTON BLEND FABRIC: Rich cotton fabric blended with polyester, natural effect makes the panels more draped and aesthetic. Premium soft touch feeling on these elegant draperies, and a refined style to the room. LIGHT FILTERING SEMI SHEER: Unlike ordinary sheer curtains, the woven texture in the fabric is not too sheer, which protecting privacy while properly allowing enough natural light to flow into the room during the day. WARM TIPS: Not pure white background, but a little natural cream. Package includes 2 panels in 50 inch wide by 84 inch long each, 100 by 84 combined. Machine washable in cold water, gentle cycle, tumble dry. Cool iron if needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91W7kXS140L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEETSKY","source_asin":"B0BTGS3QD1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-647688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTGS3QD1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTGS3QD1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":647689,"name":"Joydeco 48 Inches Wide Cordless Blackout Window Grey Fabric Blinds and Shades for Indoor Outdoor Windows Light Blocking Sun Protection (48x 75)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nDWqz7n1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Safety】Joydeco cordless roller blind providing a child-safe, pet-safe, and senior-friendly environment. The cords on corded blinds can pose a strangulation hazard to small children (and pets), so Joydeco cordless blinds and shades can bring additional peace of mind. 【Ease of Use】Joydeco cordless window blinds and shades implements the spring mechanism when in operation. In most cases, you simply adjust the blinds up/down by hand, it can be much easier for elderly customers or people with arthritis issues in their hands. Manipulating small cords can be a problem for many people, and cordless lift options eliminate this. 【Privacy & 100% Blackout】Joydeco corded free blackout roller blinds play a key role in adding privacy to your home,office,living room,bedroom,patio reducing glare while you watch TV or work on your computer, and ensuring a good night's sleep with no light leakage. Our window shades with thermal insulation can also prevent heat loss and intrusion, depending on the season. 【Material】Joydeco corded free roller shades stays cleaning with its anti-static, dustproof, and waterproof properties. The shade also helps reduce noise from outside and can help balance the temperature in a room because of its thick fabric. It takes only a damp cloth or a feather duster to remove dirt and dust from this shade. 【INSIDE & OUTSIDE MOUNT】For inside mount, the blinds width should be 0.4 inch shorter than window width, min install depth is 2\"; For outside mount, the blind width should be 2-4 inches or longer than window width.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nDWqz7n1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joydeco","source_asin":"B0B8C2L3VV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-647689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8C2L3VV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8C2L3VV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
