window.products.push({"id":647691,"name":"Umbra 244677-411-REM Cappa 1-1/4” Front and ¾” Back Windows-72 to 144” Double Drapery Rod, 72 to 144-Inches, Nickel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mE+ryXWCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Windows are an essential part of your home and provide a unique opportunity to dramatically improve the aesthetic of each room simply by adding attractive curtains or drapes. But to get it just right you need a curtain rod that works in harmony with your chosen curtains or drapes to enhance the room décor, not overpower it. Introducing Cappa Double Curtain Rod by Umbra With a modern yet understated design, the Cappa double curtain rod is a perfect way to complement your curtains or drapes without drawing attention away from them. The clean, minimalistic styling and attractive modern finish is a decorator’s dream come true because Cappa works with a wide variety of decorative styles and color palettes. Sturdy, Adjustable & Stylish When it comes to curtain rods, quality construction is important and Cappa doesn’t disappoint. Unlike cheaply made rods that tend to bend or warp over time, each Cappa double curtain rod from Umbra is made of high-quality metal and individually checked for quality assurance. The result is a super-sturdy double rod that will support a variety of window fashions, including light to medium-weight curtains, up to a max weight of 22lbs. Your Cappa double curtain rod conveniently adjusts and gives you the flexibility to accommodate 2 or 4 curtain panel configurations. Plus, everything you need to get it set up fast comes in the box, including 4 matching metal finials, 3 adjustable wall-mounted curtain rod brackets, screws, drywall anchors and easy-to-follow installation instructions. Instantly Upgrade Your Home Décor with the Cappa Double Curtain Rod by Umbra. About Umbra: A global product design company providing original, modern, casual, and functional design for the home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mE+ryXWCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Umbra","source_asin":"B07YXPLXT8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-647691","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YXPLXT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YXPLXT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
