window.products.push({"id":647757,"name":"EatNeat 5 pc Cutting Board and Kitchen Knife Set - Premium Plastic Cutting Boards and Kitchen Knife Set, Home Essentials Kit Includes Stainless Steel ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CziddJ9JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE #1 CUTTING BOARDS AND KNIFE SET! If you are looking for the best cutting board set for your kitchen, then you have found the top choice! Our EatNeat 5 piece set is perfect for every home! This set includes 3 BPA-Free chopping boards (small, medium, and large), and also features a 7” Santoku knife. This is the perfect multi-tasking 3-in-1 knife for mincing, slicing, and dicing. 3 GREAT SIZES A CUT ABOVE THE REST: Is your cutting board either too large or too small for the job at hand? Our clever EatNeat set includes 3 great sizes: Large (15.8” x 8.4”), Medium (13.8” x 8.3”), and Small (9.8” x 5.8”). Perfect for carving a Sunday roast, slicing bread, or chopping carrots… You'll always have the perfect sized cutting board! This is the perfect set for your RV, your holiday home, or as part of a college essentials kit! PREMIUM ERGONOMIC DESIGN: Make meal prepping chores an absolute breeze with our premium EatNeat cutting boards and knife set! The lightweight 7” Santoku knife features an ergonomic soft grip handle for safe and effortless slicing! The non-slip rubber trim on our cutting boards will provide the perfect stable and secure cutting surface. You can now slice, chop, and dice with the confidence of a professional chef! CUTTING EDGE CUTLERY! Crafted from premium quality stainless steel, our Santoku knife is razor sharp so you can prepare your favorite meals with zero effort! To keep the knife blade sharper for longer, we've also included a plastic knife sheath. Now you can store your EatNeat knife in your kitchen drawer safely with complete peace of mind! THE PERFECT GIFT IDEA: Are looking for a thoughtful gift idea for Christmas, Birthdays, Weddings, Housewarming Gifts, and other Holidays? Our premium 5 piece Cutting Board and Knife Set makes the ultimate gift for anyone who spends time in the kitchen! Our deluxe cutting boards feature deep juice grooves to keep all the mess on your cutting boards, and your kitchen counters clean! Click the yellow “Add to Cart” button today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CziddJ9JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EatNeat","source_asin":"B0BNJY52V7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-647757","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNJY52V7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNJY52V7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
