window.products.push({"id":647965,"name":"The Magic Is In You 1\" Goldstone Crystal Heart with Description Card","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sxTina5TL._AC_SL1305_.jpg","description":"These genuine Goldstone Carved Hearts measure approximately 1 inch to 1 & 1/4 inch wide/tall, by 1/2 inch thick. Each Heart comes individually packaged with a description card and detailed crystal Programming Instructions and Cleansing Instructions.  About Goldstone: Goldstone has existed for centuries, but its true origin remains a mystery. Some claim that this man-made stone was created as alchemists attempted to turn metal into gold. Others claim that Goldstone originated in an Italian factory when molten copper was accidentally poured into molten glass. Still others site monks as the creators of Goldstone, having used it as a source of income for their monasteries.  Goldstone is a symbol of ingenuity, ambition, and drive. It’s an uplifting stone. It reduces tension, revitalizes body and mind, and encourages a positive attitude. Goldstone is also considered a protection stone, as well as an attractant of prosperity and love.  Physically, Goldstone reduces stomach tension, improves metabolism, heals infections, strengthens the nervous system, and aids tissue regeneration. It helps with circulation, strengthens bones, and decreases pain from rheumatism and arthritis.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sxTina5TL._AC_SL1305_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Magic Is In You","source_asin":"B07D7HXTTM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-647965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D7HXTTM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D7HXTTM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
